+### Heroic Icy Veins Difference
+
+- Icy Veins emphasizes the standard heroic plan: raid stacks in front during `Blood Rage` and splits the cleave with heavy raid cooldowns.
+- The video-derived notes include the Brewmaster solo-soak as a major alternate plan, which changes the whole phase by letting the raid stay spread.
+- Practical call: use standard stacked soaking unless you have a proven solo-soak tank and cooldown chain; solo-soak simplifies `Displaced Energy` but makes one tank assignment critical.
+
 ### Quick Reminders
 
 - Spread for phase 1; stack for phase 2 unless using the Brewmaster solo-soak plan.
